                                                "sense_id": "f4d08bb8-fb18-3e45-bc4b-12241d479a24",
                                                "text": "Sylvanshine had once been on a first date with a Xerox rep who had complex and slightly repulsive patterns of callus on her fingers from playing the banjo semi-professionally"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
